			"Message": "style(Maintain): Apply consistent formatting and lint allowances across Maintain crate\n\nStandardize whitespace formatting in README.md, example, and test files by adding consistent blank lines around struct fields, function bodies, and test cases. Add `#![allow(...)]` attributes to Eliminate.rs to suppress non-standard naming and unused code warnings inherent to the GritQL transform test patterns.\n\nREADME.md consolidates the emoji into the component title text and removes separate emoji table cells for cleaner rendering. All changes are non-functional formatting improvements maintaining PascalCase conventions.",
